imary weather condition example:Partly cloudy type:string] max_precip_prob:map[description:Maximum precipitation probability (0-100) example:%!s(int=30) type:integer] max_wind_speed:map[description:Maximum wind speed in km/h example:%!s(float64=15.5) type:number] temperature_range:map[description:Temperature range in Celsius example:15.5°C ~ 22.3°C type:string] trend:map[description:Temperature trend (warming/cooling/stable) example:warming type:string]] type:object]] type:object] type:array] forecast_days:map[description:Number of days in the forecast (1-16) example:%!s(int=3) type:integer] overall_insights:map[description:Overall weather trends and patterns for the forecast period example:[Overall temperature trend: Warming up over the forecast period Rain expected on 2 day(s) during the forecast period] items:map[type:string] type:array]] type:object]] map[description:传入date获取date对应日期和时间的详细信息，只要问今天适合干什么，问今天的运势，只要关于运气，玄学等等关于气运的都要调用这个接口。
